      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-m/q14-solution-3.svg\" alt=\"Thus the impact speed is 4.26 m s−1 [M1] [A1] to three significant figures: [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:520.0px\"></figure>",
      "<p class=\"madas-total\">Total mark for question 14 is 14 marks.</p>"
